    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town of Wardensville sits on the east bank of the Cacapon River at its confluence with Trout Run.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wardensville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wardensville is located west of the Great North Mountain range, which separates the town from the Shenandoah Valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
