      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wardensville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Cline Blacksmith Shop on Main Street was built around 1830 and later served as the town jail.",
